3 830,275 829,277 827,277 827,278 825,278 824,280 820,281 819,283 815,284 815,97 816,97 817,91 819,90 819,88 820,88 820,86 822,85 823,82 825,82 826,80 828,80 828,79 830,79 830,78 832,78 832,77 834,77 834,76 842,75Z M696,174L697,174 698,179 699,179 700,181 702,181 702,182 755,182 755,181 757,181 757,180 759,179 760,174 761,174 761,114 760,114 760,112 759,112 758,109 756,109 756,108 701,108 701,109 697,112 697,115 696,115Z M431,176L432,176 432,178 433,178 435,181 437,181 437,182 494,182 494,181 495,181 495,108 436,108 436,109 434,109 434,110 432,111 432,113 431,113Z M916,176L917,176 917,113 916,113 916,111 915,111 913,108 853,108 853,182 911,182 911,181 913,181 913,180 916,178Z\"/></g></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-brand{box-sizing:border-box;position:relative;isolation:isolate;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;direction:ltr;height:42px;min-height:42px;padding:0 4px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:transparent;color:#272329;cursor:pointer}.ds-brand-mark,.ds-brand-wordmark{display:block;flex:none}.ds-brand::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;border:2px solid #A91F33;border-radius:8px;opacity:0;pointer-events:none}.ds-brand:focus-visible{outline:none}.ds-brand:focus-visible::after{opacity:1}.ds-brand:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:default}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Red Download Mark",
    "overview": "Vydrop uses the selected integrated angular V/down-arrow and geometric ydrop wordmark. The V alone is the taskbar, window and extension icon. Both theme variants share identical contours, switching only lettering Ink. Existing red app roles, bilingual working layout, focus and compatibility IDs remain intact.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "One flat red mark and a custom vector wordmark across desktop and companion.",
      "Continuous Page ground with tonal control faces and quiet separators.",
      "English/Arabic task direction with stable physical header and pane anchors.",
      "Short, silent, finite feedback that respects Windows animation and high contrast preferences."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "body": "BrandFill is identity paint; Action is a filled control; Accent is a readable detail. Preserve independent semantic status roles and system high-contrast substitutions.",
        "section": "colors",
        "name": "The Role Rule"
      },
      {
        "body": "Use the approved integrated angular wordmark: the symmetrical red V/down-arrow emblem is the first letter, followed by geometric ydrop in theme Ink. There is no separate symbol before the word. The V has equal mirrored arms, a centered download arrow and a sharp lower point. Canonical contours are in assets/brand/wordmark.geometry.json, with the selected reference in assets/brand/approved-reference.png; scripts/draw-brand-lettering.ps1 applies them to Symbols.xaml. The 966 × 284-unit source fits a 128 × 38-DIP Viewbox inside the existing 42-DIP fixed-height button. Preserve physical LTR order in Arabic and the overlay focus ring. Light mode uses charcoal ydrop; dark mode uses light ydrop; BrandFill stays red. Taskbar, window, standalone app and extension icons contain only the V, from BrandMarkGeometry on its 64-unit canvas. Retain Inter for interface text and its existing license. The download arrow inside the V is filled solid white, with no outline.",
        "section": "typography",
        "name": "The Lettering Rule"
      },
      {
        "body": "Use Page, Surface, Field and thin borders for depth. Inspected native themes define no shared application shadow token.",
        "section": "elevation",
        "name": "Tonal Depth"
      },
      {
        "body": "The split threshold is computed from client width, MinWidth, chrome and the 320-DIP pane minimum. The 1000-DIP constant only guards automatic expansion; it is not a universal responsive breakpoint.",
        "section": "layout",
        "name": "Content Fit"
      },
      {
        "name": "Tonal Ramp Metadata",
        "body": "The eight-step OKLCH ramps are synthesized display metadata derived from each canonical hexadecimal token: constant hue and chroma, stepped lightness from 15% to 95%. They do not introduce application theme tokens or change the normative palette.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Stable Focus Rule",
        "body": "The brand action keeps its fixed 42-DIP height and four-DIP horizontal padding. Its two-DIP Accent focus ring is painted as an overlay inside fixed bounds; clicking, pressing or focusing cannot alter header height or move the following content.",
        "section": "components"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do use semantic light/dark pairs and preserve Windows high contrast.",
      "Do keep labels, checkmarks and keyboard focus alongside color.",
      "Do preserve approved layout, type, control geometry and finite silent motion.",
      "Do reuse the canonical vector lockup and preserve its LTR direction.",
      "Do label synthetic evidence and retain raster provenance."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Do not restore historical ViFree lettering or superseded brand palettes on current Vydrop surfaces.",
      "Do not recreate the wordmark as ordinary text.",
      "Do not fabricate media details, artwork or success.",
      "Do not add sound, looping decoration or motion that overrides Windows preferences.",
      "Do not rename persisted compatibility identifiers as part of a visible rebrand."
    ]
  }
}
